('Half-It', 'Play the selected preset’s sequence of targets. Qualifying hits add points; a visit with no qualifying score halves your accumulated total, rounded down.', [('Make the target count', 'Number, bull and segment challenges reward hitting what the round asks for. The changing targets bring pressure to a practice session. Supports 1–16 players.')]),
